==English==

===Etymology===
From latin word [[assonare]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# the [[repetition]] of similar or identical [[vowel]] sounds (though with different [[consonant]]s), usually in [[literature]] or [[poetry]].
#:Example: "lifting its big glinting wing, it hit"

